        "text": "  or power data is available in this file."
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "These files are generated from python scripts of the Chips4Makers based IHP SG13G2"
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "PDK. The code can be found in the"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": "[c4m-pdk-ihpsg13g2](https://gitlab.com/Chips4Makers/c4m-pdk-ihpsg13g2.git) repo."
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "This library is built from version `0.0.4` of that source code."
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": "The `README.md` file of this project explains how to use the code in there. The whole"
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "build of the files plus preparation of the files described above for upstreaming can be"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "generated with the command `pdm doit patch4upstream`."
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": "It also contains externally contributed files:"
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "* cdl/sg13g2_io.cdl: CDL netlist"
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "* verilog/sg13g2_io.v: Verilog netlist"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": "* lib/sg13g2_io_*.lib: Liberty files with timing"
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "18.06.2026  I/O Update 2 resolved issues:"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "=========================================================================================="
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "\t  - VIH/VIL input threshold parameters are fixed (cdl and layout) to be in spec."
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": "\t  - Receiver (input): Delay balance is fixed (cdl and layout)."
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "\t  - Issue #401. Analog Pad current capability is improved."
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "\t  - Issue #385. M2 connections in ground pads are improved."
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": "\t  - Issue #419. Antenna diode structures were added to core inputs (layout fix)."
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "\t  - Issue #835. Layout of edges of cells is aligned to provide abutment without DRC errors."
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "\t  - Issue #676. Liberty models are updated. New look-up tables with increased loads are used. Fillers and corner are added in Liberty and verilog model."
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "\t  - Issue #909. Contacts are added in Filler200 cell."
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": "\t  - Celllist is updated: subblocks are not library cells."
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "\t  - \"sg13g2_Galery\" top layout is removed from GDS 2 layout view."
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "\t  - CDL netlist is regenerated."
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "\t  - SPICE netlist is regenerated and renamed to \"sg13g2_io.spice\" to align the naming with sg13g2_stdcell library."
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "\t  - Pin direction in LEF is fixed."
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "\t   "
      }
    ]
